of the tremendous odor in this tomb. Judging from the smell, and new, bloated
appearance, the corpse couldn't be more than a few days old. The cause of death
seems to have been starvation. But what could have made a man choose certain
excruciating death by starvation over the chance of survival in the open
desert?
